/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/sparks-copy-5cfd7c6b4af74-252x300.jpg 252w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/sparks-copy-5cfd7c6b4af74.jpg 482w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 252px) 100vw, 252px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p><\/p><\/div><div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<h3><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-5092 no-wp-caption aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/mavericks-5cfd7cf99d51c-252x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"252\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/mavericks-5cfd7cf99d51c-252x300.jpg 252w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/06\/mavericks-5cfd7cf99d51c.jpg 482w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 252px) 100vw, 252px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<h3>Want To Dance On The Clouds?<\/h3>\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">We now offer a low lying fog option with the Chauvet Nimbus<\/p>\n<h3><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">\n<h3><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-4581 no-wp-caption aligncenter\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/clouds11-300x194.png\" alt=\"clouds11\" width=\"300\" height=\"194\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/clouds11-300x194.png 300w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/clouds11.png 312w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/h3>\n<h3><strong><\/strong><\/h3><\/p><\/div><strong><div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-medium wp-image-4580 no-wp-caption aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/cloud2-300x194.png\" alt=\"cloud2\" width=\"300\" height=\"194\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/cloud2-300x194.png 300w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/cloud2.png 312w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<h3><\/h3>\n<h3><strong><\/strong><\/h3><\/div><\/strong><strong><div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<h3>We Use a State-of-the-Art Sound System Consisting of Components from:<\/h3>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400;\">\n<li>Shure Wireless Microphones<\/li>\n<li>Rane \/ Denon Mixers<\/li>\n<li>JBL &amp; EV Powered Speakers<\/li>\n<li>Professional Sound Cards &amp; Surge Protectors<\/li>\n<li>Virtual DJ &amp; PCDJ Dex 2.0 Professional DJ Software<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><strong><\/strong><\/h3><\/div><\/strong><\/div><\/h3>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 20px;\"><strong><em>Our systems also consist of wireless microphones for more crowd interaction.<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 20px;\"><em><em><em>Part of our success comes from keeping up with new equipment and technologies. We use state of the art equipment and we are always upgrading to the latest and greatest equipment to ensure that your event will go off without a hitch. We do this to provide the best and most unique experience for your elite event.<\/em><\/em><\/em><\/p>\n<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/about-us\/equipment\/attachment\/jbl\/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-613\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4591 no-wp-caption aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/Shure.jpg\" alt=\"Shure\" width=\"193\" height=\"46\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p><\/p><\/div><div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4586 no-wp-caption aligncenter\" style=\"color: #0000ee;\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/JBL.jpg\" alt=\"JBL\" width=\"193\" height=\"193\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/JBL.jpg 193w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/JBL-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 193px) 100vw, 193px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><\/p><\/div><div class=\"col-sm-4\">\n<p><em><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4582 no-wp-caption aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/ev-logo.png\" alt=\"ev-logo\" width=\"197\" height=\"197\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/ev-logo.png 197w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/ev-logo-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 197px) 100vw, 197px\" \/><\/em><\/p>\n<p><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3><em>Our Sound Equipment is top of the line:<\/em><\/h3>\n<p><em>We pride ourselves on superior sound for our event which is why we spare no expense in our speakers, we have out JBL PRX 615 which has a higher grade 15&#8243; sub woofer with a max of 1000 watts per speaker.<\/em><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><em>With ZLX, Electro-Voice set out with a singular goal: to deliver best-in-class performance across every detail. ZLX combines decades of proven pro-audio engineering know-how with a bold new look and user-friendly features that give you an extraordinary amount of control over your sound \u2013 all with the renowned EV quality and reliability the pros trust.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-4583 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/ev-zlx-300x243.png\" alt=\"ev-zlx\" width=\"300\" height=\"243\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/ev-zlx-300x243.png 300w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/ev-zlx.png 422w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><strong class=\"desc\">1500W Powered PA Subwoofer with 18&#8243; Differential Drive low-frequency driver<\/strong> <span class=\"adddesc\">The JBL PRX718XLF Powered PA Subwoofer delivers your bass with accuracy and power. <\/span><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-4597 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/PRX718XLF-300x300.png\" alt=\"PRX718XLF\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/PRX718XLF-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/PRX718XLF-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/PRX718XLF.png 500w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><em>If you are looking for a portable smaller ceremony or cocktail hour option, we currently run the Fender Passport 600 system.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4584 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/FenderPassport-300pro.jpg\" alt=\"FenderPassport-300pro\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/FenderPassport-300pro.jpg 250w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/FenderPassport-300pro-150x150.jpg 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 250px) 100vw, 250px\" \/><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-medium wp-image-4592 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/shureulx-300x206.jpg\" alt=\"shureulx\" width=\"300\" height=\"206\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/shureulx-300x206.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/shureulx.jpg 314w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>The <b>Shure ULX Professional Series<\/b> wireless microphone systems provide professional wireless microphone solutions for broadcast, performances, professional mobile entertainment events, conferences, schools, and businesses. The system includes the ULXP4 diversity receiver, ULX1 body-pack transmitter and WL185 lavalier microphone.<\/p>\n<h3>Lighting<\/h3>\n<p>JAMMIN\u2019 DJs has by far one of the best light show options customizable for any look or feel you can imagine. We can provide you something simple and elegant or literally having you dancing on a cloud! Here are some of the lighting design options we offer:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dancing On The Clouds<\/li>\n<li>Wireless Up-lighting<\/li>\n<li>Decor Lighting Systems<\/li>\n<li>Personalized Monogram<\/li>\n<li>Architectural Up-Lighting<\/li>\n<li>Intelligent Lighting<\/li>\n<li>Laser Light Shows<\/li>\n<li>UV\/Black Lighting<\/li>\n<li>LED State of the Art Floor Lighting<\/li>\n<li>Many Other Professional Components<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Here are examples of our \u201cComplimentary Basic Dance Floor Lighting\u201d options:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4590 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/PARTYLEDscan1.png\" alt=\"PARTYLEDscan1\" width=\"236\" height=\"250\" \/><em>Party LED I includes a American DJ Starball LED (MirrorBall Type Effect) ColorPalette with audio sync plus CSL 4 channel wireless remote control system. Operating modes: &#8211; Blackout\/static\/dimmer\/strobe &#8211; RGB color mixing &#8211; Color fade &#8211; Automatic built-in programs with sound activation .<\/em><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4588 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/l_partyled5ft.png\" alt=\"l_partyled5ft\" width=\"250\" height=\"248\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/l_partyled5ft.png 250w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/l_partyled5ft-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 250px) 100vw, 250px\" \/><em><em>Party Box Led V includes 4 Channel LED ColorPalette with audio sync and the American Dj or Sunray or Starball LED (MirrorBall Effect) 2 Chauvet LX5 LED Moonflower Lights CSL 4 channel wireless remote control system : &#8211; Blackout\/static\/dimmer\/strobe &#8211; RGB color mixing &#8211; Color fade &#8211; Automatic built-in programs with sound activation The Control is a CSL 4 channel wireless system with Channel 1 operating the Ball effect Channel 2 operates the moonflower light effect . The LX5 is a LED moonflower effect with Sound sensitivity knob &#8211; Ultra bright LEDs.<\/em><\/em><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4587 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/l_PARTY1best.png\" alt=\"l_PARTY1best\" width=\"224\" height=\"250\" \/><em><em>Party LED I includes a American DJ Starball LED (MirrorBall Type Effect) ColorPalette with audio sync plus CSL 4 channel wireless remote control system.. Operating modes: &#8211; Blackout\/static\/dimmer\/strobe &#8211; RGB color mixing &#8211; Color fade &#8211; Automatic built-in programs with sound activation Starball LED .<\/em><\/em><\/p>\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\n<div>\n<h3>Cold Sparks<\/h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright size-medium wp-image-5863 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/TWFE-Halloween-Styled-Shoot-Z6A-5249-5f98c332a75ed-200x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/TWFE-Halloween-Styled-Shoot-Z6A-5249-5f98c332a75ed-200x300.jpg 200w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/TWFE-Halloween-Styled-Shoot-Z6A-5249-5f98c332a75ed-681x1024.jpg 681w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/TWFE-Halloween-Styled-Shoot-Z6A-5249-5f98c332a75ed-768x1154.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/10\/TWFE-Halloween-Styled-Shoot-Z6A-5249-5f98c332a75ed-1022x153