o operate.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<h3>Here are Some Of Our Available Upgraded Lighting Packages<\/h3>\n<p><strong><em>Uplighting<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4593 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/uplights.png\" alt=\"uplights\" width=\"518\" height=\"408\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/uplights.png 518w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/uplights-300x236.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 518px) 100vw, 518px\" \/><strong><em>Monogram Gobo light<br \/>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4589 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/monogram-gobo.png\" alt=\"monogram-gobo\" width=\"553\" height=\"396\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/monogram-gobo.png 553w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/monogram-gobo-300x215.png 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 553px) 100vw, 553px\" \/><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>Intelligent Lighting<\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>The Vizi Spot LED Pro is a high performance moving head lighting fixture with two effects in one. Not only does it feature a hard edge spot beam, but it also has a frost wash effect as well.<\/em><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-4594 no-wp-caption\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/visi-spots-pro-led.jpg\" alt=\"visi-spots-pro-led\" width=\"688\" height=\"700\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/visi-spots-pro-led.jpg 688w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/visi-spots-pro-led-295x300.jpg 295w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 688px) 100vw, 688px\" \/><strong>Additional Services by JAMMIN&#8217; DJs:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><i>P